        "LIST_231": "Ooltewah's Walnut Run Subdivision Welcomes you Home to Cash Lane. Conveniently located 3 miles to the heart of Ooltewah. Notice the rich hardwood floors and soaring ceilings. The great room also offers a stone gas fireplace surrounded with natural light and a built-in above. Rich wood custom cabinetry in the kitchen including a hood over the oven to match, granite countertops, and stainless steal appliances. Space at the kitchen bar top for a quick bite, the breakfast nook off the kitchen with access to the back screened in porch, or the separate formal dining room. The spacious Master on the main features an ensuite with double vanity, jetted tub, separate tiled shower with walk-in-closet. Downstairs also offers a half bath and laundry room.",
